WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.920
You're doing great just a little further to go.

2
00:00:02.920 --> 00:00:04.840
A few things to keep in mind tonight.

3
00:00:04.840 --> 00:00:08.640
If you haven't had a bowel movement yet after starting your prep, don't panic.

4
00:00:08.640 --> 00:00:10.760
It can take a couple of hours to kick in.

5
00:00:10.760 --> 00:00:13.360
Keep drinking your clear liquids and stay patient.

6
00:00:13.360 --> 00:00:17.560
Also, continue to avoid all solid foods and alcohol.

7
00:00:17.560 --> 00:00:21.040
And if you're on a split-dose prep, your second dose is coming up.

8
00:00:21.040 --> 00:00:23.360
There's a separate video walking you through that.

9
00:00:23.360 --> 00:00:28.120
Lastly, before you go to sleep, confirm your arrival time with your driver for

10
00:00:28.120 --> 00:00:28.640
tomorrow. You're

11
00:00:28.640 --> 00:00:31.640
doing everything right. Get some rest and we'll see you soon.
